WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Ryu hits Ken with standing heavy kick after the reversal recovery.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.000
Ryu reaches the crumpling opponent with crouching heavy punch.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Ryu juggles Ken with light Hashogeki.

4
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.600
Ryu sweeps the falling opponent.

5
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.500
Ryu glows blue while charging Denjin after the sweep.
